OL,3,GNEWSAAgricultural show returns for bank
OL,4,Aholiday weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers, livestock exhibitors and
OL,7,Fequestrian competitors will be showing
OL,8,Ftheir animals at an annual agricultural
OL,9,Fshow.
OL,11,FThe Edenbridge and Oxted Agricultural
OL,12,FShow takes place on Sunday and Monday,
OL,13,Fwith visitors from across the South
OL,14,FEast able to see livestock
OL,15,Fcompetitions, equestrian events,
OL,16,Fcountry sports and main ring
OL,17,Fentertainment.
OL,19,FOrganisers said that this year's show
OL,20,Fcame after "one of the toughest growing
OL,21,Fseasons in recent years" for farmers.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
