OL,3,GNEWSAAgricultural show returns for bank
OL,4,Aholiday weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokeswoman said that the event
OL,7,Fmarked the end of the farming season,
OL,8,Fwhen months of work breeding, rearing
OL,9,Fand preparing animals come together in
OL,10,Fthe show ring.
